      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  \n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n\n        <button id=\"fetch-button\">\n            ▶ Run Code\n        </button>\n\n        <div id=\"data-output\" class=\"output-box\">\n            <p class=\"placeholder\"></p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* General Page Layout */\nbody {\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n    background-color: #f4f4f9;\n    color: #333;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding-top: 50px;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n\n.container {\n    background: white;\n    width: 250px;\n    height: 400px;\n    padding: 30px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n}\n\nh1 {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n    margin-top: 0;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* Status Text */\n.status-text {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    color: #555;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* Button Styling */\n#fetch-button {\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 12px;\n    background-color: #00ad2b; /* Blue */\n    color: white;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: background 0.3s;\n}\n\n#fetch-button:hover {\n    background-color: #0056b3; /* Darker Blue */\n}\n\n/* Output Box Styling */\n.output-box {\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    border: 1px solid #e1e1e1;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    padding: 15px;\n    background-color: #fafafa;\n    min-height: 300px;\n    max-height: 600px; /* Limits height */\n    overflow-y: auto;  /* Adds scrollbar if list is long */\n}\n\n.placeholder {\n    color: #999;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-style: italic;\n}\n\n/* Dynamic List Items (Created by JS) */\nul {\n    list-style-type: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n\nli {\n    padding: 8px 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\nli:last-child {\n    border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n/* Error Message Class */\n.error-msg {\n    color: #dc3545; /* Red */\n    background-color: #ffe6e6;\n    padding: 10px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    border: 1px solid #ffcccc;\n    text-align: center;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "const dataOutput = document.getElementById('data-output');\n\nconst fetchPets = async () => {\n  const dataOutput = document.getElementById('data-output');\n  const API_URL = \"https://data.austintexas.gov/resource/kz4x-q9k5.json\";\n\n  dataOutput.innerHTML = '<p class=\"status-text\">Fetching furry friends...</p>';\n\n  const response = await fetch(API_URL);\n  const data = await response.json();\n  const firstPet = data[0]\n         \n\n\n  \n};\n\n\n\n// Event listener using an arrow function\ndocument.getElementById('fetch-button').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    fetchPets();\n});",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "1",
        "2",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "### Do This:\r\n\r\nUse dot notation on `firstPet` to access each value and display it in `dataOutput`.\r\n1. **Find the Breed** - Access the value of `looks_like`.\r\n2. **Locate the Latitude** - Access `latitude` inside the `location` object.\r\n3. **Get the Image Link** - Access the `url` inside the `image` object.\r\n",
